OL,3,GNEWSAAir ambulance called to serious
OL,4,Acollision
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe air ambulance and other emergency
OL,7,Fservices are at the scene of a
OL,8,F"serious" collision, Suffolk Police
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FDebenham Road near Little Stonham was
OL,12,Fclosed at about 11:00 BST between the
OL,13,FA140 Norwich Road and Middlewood Green,
OL,14,Fthe force added.
OL,16,FParamedics and fire crews are also in
OL,17,Fattendance, and people at the scene
OL,18,Fhave reported on social media that two
OL,19,Fair ambulances have landed in a nearby
OL,20,Ffield.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
